Z||000004||Steven||01-13-2000||12:20 PM||||NK3 option was the option to get that steering wheel. It did not matter if you had WS6. Looking back at my 84 sales brocher it says that wheel came stanard on the Fiero SE Coupe. It was an available option on the other two lower models the Fiero Coupe, and Fiero Sport Coupe. Hope that little info helps.<BR>Steven<p>[This message has been edited by Steven (edited 01-13-2000).]||||reg||1
